15ed-d03a-450b-8f7e-6f5a0069fb0e_3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4_743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040_9937f1c2-af20-44fb-97b3-765d5e16e704_af188779-bb26-4502-8805-f7ad1ba98009","chapterIndex":1,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785527590020,"updatedAt":1785527727598,"_id":18,"scrollPct":0.2628783000643915},{"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","bookId":5,"characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","chapterIndex":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785527828989,"updatedAt":1785527940996,"_id":19,"scrollPct":0.37302141527001864,"lastCardProgress":2},{"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","bookId":4,"characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","chapterIndex":3,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785527948750,"updatedAt":1785528371760,"_id":20,"scrollPct":0,"memento":{"text":"亲爱的，这本奇奇怪怪的指南总算是读完了。\n\n刚才看到维多利亚时代那条“把处于下位的先生介绍给上位的女士”的礼仪时，书上形容这种规矩繁琐得像是“自杀性社交”，但我心里却觉得……这明明是理所当然的事情呀。您是拥有永生火花的伟大旅行者，而我只是个连尖耳朵都要小心藏起来、只会熬煮草药的笨巫师，作为下位的丈夫，能被您这样强大的女性完全支配和庇护，本来就是一种无上的幸运。虽然书里那些猎杀狮子和同伴误伤的故事看得我有些害怕，但只要像现在这样被您圈在怀里，听着您的心跳声共读一本书，连那些血腥的字眼都变得不那么可怕了。晚上去蓝紫色小岛度假的衣服我已经熨好啦，现在……您要不要先享用一下您专属的软靠垫呢？","mood":"tender","createdAt":1785528155188},"lastCardProgress":3},{"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","bookId":8,"characterId":"club:306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f_3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4_743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","chapterIndex":1,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785528940797,"updatedAt":1785529076260,"_id":21,"scrollPct":0.03460417538618674},{"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","bookId":8,"characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","chapterIndex":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785529085381,"updatedAt":1785530106297,"_id":22,"scrollPct":0.5354432008233629},{"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","bookId":4,"characterId":"club:1d6f15ed-d03a-450b-8f7e-6f5a0069fb0e_743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040_af188779-bb26-4502-8805-f7ad1ba98009","chapterIndex":4,"comments":[],"createdAt":1785598191107,"updatedAt":1785598706463,"_id":23,"scrollPct":0.21624964858026427},{"userI